{"ref":"character:carmilla","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Carmilla is a secret playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. She starts with ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Hatred.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Hatred","r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}," as a hidden weapon."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_CARMILLA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Carmilla_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[["None"]]},{"label":"Hidden weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Hatred.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Hatred","r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["May the power of the first Belmont break her mask."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["200"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+80%"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["+100%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Skip","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+10"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"May the power of the first Belmont break her mask.\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Black_Disk.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:black-disk"}," ",{"t":"Black Disk","r":"relic:black-disk"}," in ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"},", Carmilla will appear in the stage as a boss enemy, where her summoning circle is located directly east of the ",{"i":"Sprite-Capra_Gate.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:capra-gate"}," ",{"t":"Capra Gate","r":"relic:capra-gate"},". Upon evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Hex.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"weapon:hex"}," ",{"t":"Hex","r":"weapon:hex"}," into the ",{"i":"Sprite-Nightmare.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:nightmare"}," ",{"t":"Nightmare","r":"weapon:nightmare"}," and defeating her with it, Carmilla is unlocked as a playable character. The ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"}," zones summoned by ",{"i":"Sprite-Nightmare.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:nightmare"}," ",{"t":"Nightmare","r":"weapon:nightmare"}," must land the final hit against Carmilla. Luckily, these zones will instantly defeat Carmilla, playing a \"pop\" noise when it happens."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Carmilla can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Carmilla can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"weepingmask\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Carmilla starts with the following bonuses:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["+100 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}]},{"c":["+1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}]},{"c":["+80% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}]},{"c":["+20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"}]},{"c":["+100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"}]},{"c":["+10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"}]},{"c":["+10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Skip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:skip"}," ",{"t":"Skip","r":"powerup:skip"}]},{"c":["+10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Carmilla has a charging ability whose duration is decreased by ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"},", and when activated, triggers ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Hatred.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Hatred","r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Anger.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-anger"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Anger","r":"weapon:dominus-anger"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Agony.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-agony"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Agony","r":"weapon:dominus-agony"}," if they are equipped. Carmilla is also immune to health drain and can also fly over walls and obstacles."]},{"k":"p","c":["Carmilla can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Carmilla.png","w":82,"h":120,"c":["Carmilla's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Carmilla.gif","w":75,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]},{"i":"Unlock-Carmilla.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Secrets menu icon"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Carmilla","x":"https://castlevania.